ue":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-21T09:19:31-07:00","id":1479246,"title":"","content":"A tough list to consider and there is lots of good actors and actresses to choose from.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Tremere: Peter Cushing as an aged manipulative arch master mage would be an interesting take.<br /> <br /> Lucita De Aragon: Salma Hayek would be good as the rebel childe of Moncada.<br /> <br /> Montono: Idris Elba would bring the weight of duty to the role of Lasombra's eldest childe.<br /> <br /> Arch Bishop Monacada: Mickey Rourke can play creepy people with ease.<br /> <br /> Sasha Vykos: I think David Bowie ( I know he was mainly a singer) would be awesome as the fiend and play gender bending stuff with ease. <br /> <br /> Theo Bell: Will Smith even with the fallout of slap gate is still an awesome actor and has done serious roles before. <br /> <br /> Fathima of Banu Haquim: Penelope Cruz.<br /> <br /> Lodin/Olaf: Mel Gibson is out of left field for sure, but he would be perfect for the role as both of them have seen better days.<br /> <br /> Talley: Brad Pitt because of what I saw in Killing Them Softly.<br /> <br /> Ambridgino Giovanni: I would go with Malcolm McDowell in his early 50's. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thanked